# LLP 0013 Hermes patch 0009 — bind package principal with its compartment
# Class: B (one existing native binder extension)
# @ref LLP 0013#mechanism-3
#
# The trusted CommonJS loader already binds each freshly compiled package
# function's Domain to its authenticated compartment after `new Function`.
# Extend that same private, boot-sealed binder to stamp the package principal
# directly onto the Domain. The existing pending-principal path remains the
# creation-time mechanism and the eval/Function inheritance substrate, while
# this post-compile binding makes the module invariant explicit on source and
# HBC bootstrap profiles alike: compartment and principal describe the same
# authenticated package Domain.
